Claude outputs/
_to_delete/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Verification output is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# results/ and proverif-results.txt are the evidence that the models in this
# repository actually verify, and which tool versions produced that result.
# For a companion artefact to a paper that is worth keeping in version
# control: a reader can check the claims without installing either prover,
# and a regression shows up as a diff.
#
# If the raw logs turn out to be too noisy to track, ignore only the verbose
# per-run output and keep the summaries:
#
#   results/run-*.log
#   proverif-results.txt
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
